5. ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE

Ruzit does not officially support artificial intelligence features,
AI-generated content, or AI-assisted workflows. The Author provides no
warranty, guarantee, or support for any such use, and nothing in the
Software should be relied upon as an AI-capable or AI-safe system.

However, using AI tools to build, modify, generate content for, or
otherwise work with the Software or a Product does not by itself violate
this license and will not, on that basis alone, cause your rights under
this license to be revoked. This clause exists to protect users: you
will not lose your license simply for using AI.


